FROZEN (owner, 2026-10-30). Alembic no longer changes the schema: every schema change is a
minty-db migration (github.com/minty-oliveandvine/minty-db; python -m minty_db migrate).

This chain stays, read-only, for one job: scripts/schema_migration/rehearse.py lifts an old
pettycashv2 production dump to head with it before loading the v3 schema (the local
pettycashv3_data builds), and docker/docker-compose.yml's local stack builds its database with it.
Nothing runs it against a hosted database (the migrate.yml workflow is gone).
tests/test_zz_alembic_frozen.py fails if any file here is added, changed or removed.

-----

Single-database configuration for Flask.
